{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて～ったって～あいど～る～♪ヽ(｡･c_，･｡)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬぬッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おヒゲっ(=＾･Θ･＾=  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ衣装、載せられないので\nさゆ猫さん描いたッ^ω^ にゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばそわ！ヽ(｡･c_，･｡)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新ちょこっと遅れてしまって\nごめんね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストは無事に、ぜんぶ\n終わったよー(丿^ω^ヽ)やったあ！\nうれしいっ！ひゃっほう！∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わったときってなんだかすごく\nうれしい。(´◡`๑) えへへ\nドーナツ食べたいカリカリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風船とわたし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわ∩^ω^∩ ○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の撮影での一枚！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒かったけど楽しかったぜおっ♪♪\nみなさんに届く日がたのしみっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日中、撮影をしていました！\n最近思うに、やっぱり私はこの\n仕事がすきなんだな～ぁと\n思いますッ(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校も勉強も、すきだし、楽しい。\nだけど、ここには教科書にのってない\n大切なものがいっぱいあるなって\n試験勉強しながら、ふと気付いたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのことがすきなんだなって\nファンのみなさんのことがすきなんだなって。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、みなさんのこと大切なものにしていい？もっとすきになってもいい？(´・・｀)\nわたしからのお願いっ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  ミスドで一番好きな種類は？\nいつも食べたりするのはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  チョコファッションが\nいちばん好きです(丿^ω^ヽ)♡\nあとは、エンゼルショコラ、\nダブルチョコレート ☆☆\n(๑òωó๑)だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  さゆにゃんって苦手な教科なに～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  数学です～(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  新潟って行ったことある？\nなかったらどうゆうイメージ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  行ったことないです～(｡> <｡)\n行ってみたいなあ(´◡`๑)  ＊＊\nご飯が美味しいイメージがあります！\nほくほくの白米食べたいっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  もう5thシングルのPV撮影とかやってるんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ やってますよ～∩(*・∀・*)∩ ♪♪\n楽しみにしててくだーさゆにゃんっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  中学生役と女子大生役、やるなら？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  女子大生かな！(o^^o)\nアイドルとしての自分と\nギャップある役を演じてみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くてコート反対に着てるの図。笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかすごく\n眠たそうな顔してる（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、今日はもお寝ます！\n明日も早起き！∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとっても、素敵な\n一日になりますよおーに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/30/4818916/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}